Package: patrone-default-apps
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, patrone-browser-chooser
Recommends: patrone-file-manager, patrone-terminal, patrone-unpack
Description: PatroneOS's default apps
 PatroneOS comes with no web browser: until one's installed, web links
 open Patrone Browser Chooser, which asks which one to install. Whichever
 browser is installed then opens them, and comes first in the favorites,
 with Patrone Terminal. Folders open in Patrone File Manager, which takes
 Ubuntu's Files' place in the favorites, and archives, .deb packages and
 Flatpak files in Patrone Unpack. Users' own choices still win.
